<title>UK: United News,Warner seek UK theme park site.</title>
<headline>United News,Warner seek UK theme park site.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's United News &amp; Media Plc said on Monday that it and Warner Brothers would be seeking alternative sites for their proposed Warner Bros. Movie World studios and theme park.</p>
<p>Warner Bros. is part of Time Warner Inc.  </p>
<p>The companies said they would not pursue a planning application to build the estimated 225 million stg film-based theme park in Hillingdon, west of London, due to undisclosed problems.</p>
<p>United News said they would review the original search for sites, which took place in 1994. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
